*.iml
.kotlin
.gradle
**/build/
!src/**/build/
local.properties
.idea
.DS_Store

# THE SAMPLE GOLDENS ARE NOT COMMITTED, and that is a statement about the samples and not about
# viddik. The sample fixtures theme themselves with MaterialTheme's default typography — the way a
# consumer's own components do — so they draw in whatever font the host has and their PNGs differ
# between a mac and a Linux runner. viddik's own suite bundles a font through `viddikTypography()`
# and its goldens ARE committed and verified on three operating systems; see `verify-goldens.yaml`.
# What CI runs here is `viddikRecord`, which exercises the whole commonMain-registry path without
# claiming a portability the sample never set up for.
samples/*/src/*/snapshots/
